        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>A favored weapon of Hellknights of the Order of the Eclipse, the spiked head of this menacing flail is attached to a 2-foot-long chain that ominously suspends itself for a few seconds after each deadly blow, crackling with electricity capable of frying foes and circuits alike. If you're trained with an electroflail, on a critical hit with a Strike or [[/act trip]] attempt, you confer the glitching condition with a value equal to twice your weapon dice to one tech item wielded by your target (or the target themself, if they have the tech trait).</p>"
